# Movie Recommendation System

A Python-based project that uses data processing and recommendation
techniques to generate relevant movie suggestions.

## Overview

This project explores how structured movie data can be prepared and used
to produce recommendations.

## Technology

-   Python
-   Pandas
-   Scikit-learn

## Project work

-   Prepared and processed data with Pandas.
-   Applied recommendation techniques using Scikit-learn.
-   Reviewed the recommendation workflow using data analysis and model
    evaluation.

